{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OID4VCWallet is the wallet side of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for iOS 16 and macOS 13 and later. It handles SD-JWT VC and ISO mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Receiving"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" them from a Credential Offer (OpenID4VCI 1.0, HAIP 1.0),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the authorization code or the pre-authorized code grant, deferred","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"issuance, batches of copies and refresh.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Presenting","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" them in answer to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid4vp:\/\/"},{"type":"text","text":" request"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(OpenID4VP 1.0, HAIP 1.0), to Safari’s Digital Credentials API as an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"iOS document provider (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"org-iso-mdoc"},{"text":", ISO\/IEC TS 18013-7), and in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"person over Bluetooth (ISO\/IEC 18013-5), where the app can also be the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reader.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The protocols run in OID4VCgo’s Go code, compiled into the "},{"code":"Mobile","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"framework this package links: every network request, every protocol"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"message and every check on what comes back. Your app supplies the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform, through three protocols: a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":" whose keys never leave"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Secure Enclave, a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":" under the device’s data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"protection, and a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" that attests the wallet. It also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"owns the UI: every session stops where the holder needs to decide."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OID4VCgo is OpenID Certified for the OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"roles under HAIP, over links. The Digital Credentials API and in-person"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presentation aren’t covered by that certification.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Start with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted"},{"type":"text","text":", then the article for each task;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/IntegrationChecklist"},{"type":"text","text":" lists every step in order."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCW